# Product Requirements

## Overview
This application is intended to handle project site management with a focus on snag tracking, site observations, image-based issue marking, reporting, and client communication.

## Core requirements

### Project management
- Create and edit projects
- Maintain client and project address data
- Track project status and dates

### Snag tracking
- Add site issues and observations
- Categorize by quality, safety, schedule, or other
- Record severity and assigned person
- Track resolution status

### Attachments
- Upload images and PDF documents
- Attach them to specific issues
- Preserve metadata and file names

### Reporting
- Generate summaries by project and date
- Export to PDF or print-friendly format

### Client letters
- Draft formal written communication
- Use templates for repeated operations
- Save and re-use common letter formats

### Stability
- Use a local database
- Ensure backup and restore workflows are available
- Maintain reliable persistence for project data

## Planned implementation

- API-first app for core functionality
- Swagger support for testing
- SQLite database for persistence
- Future extension to desktop after initial stability is proven
